    "<main class=\"site-main home-page\" id=\"primary\">\n\t\n\t\t<section class=\"home-hero\" id=\"home\" style='background-image: linear-gradient(90deg, color-mix(in srgb, var(--background-dark) 72%, transparent) 0%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--background-dark) 50%, transparent) 34%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--background-dark) 8%, transparent) 74%), url(\"/assets/a399ddb102-verity_hero-e1786715846853.webp\");'>\n\t\t<div class=\"container home-hero__inner\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"home-hero__content animatedParent animateOnce\" data-sequence=\"400\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"animated fadeInLeftShort\" data-id=\"1\">Luxury Custom Homes &amp; Purposeful Development</h1>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"home-hero__desc animated fadeInLeftShort\" data-id=\"2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>Custom homes, thoughtful land development, and residential renovation throughout Charlotte, Lake Norman, and surrounding communities.</p>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"animated fadeInLeftShort\" data-id=\"3\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"vbg-btn vbg-btn--arrow\" href=\"#contact\" target=\"\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStart Your Project\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span aria-hidden=\"true\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"interface-icon\">→</span></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</section>\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\t<section class=\"home-services\" id=\"services\">\n\t\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"section-heading animatedParent animateOnce\" data-sequence=\"400\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"animated fadeInLeftShort\" data-id=\"1\">Our Services</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"after\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"service-grid animatedParent animateOnce\" data-sequence=\"400\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<article class=\"service-card animated fadeInUpShort\" data-id=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"service-card__image\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a